; Leg EF -- REGRESSION at 38400, the rate this port ships.
;
; BENCH take-file: there is no "set line" here.  ~/.kermrc names the adapter.
; CHECK THAT IT NAMES THE ONE THAT IS PLUGGED IN.
;
;  Treatment binary at the shipping rate.  Control: SS16bc leg HA --
;  26.200 s, 1,250 cps, 37,557 wire bytes, 18 packets, 0/0.
;
;  PASS IS byte-exact + rxlost=0 rxfull=0.  There is no adjacent 38400
;  control in this sitting, so the CLOCK here is not a result (SS16al).
;
; READ IT WITH:
;     python3 v9k/tools/pktstat.py --rxbytes <from STEPEF.OUT> s16bdEF.pkt
; Residual -11 clean, +28 with a startup timeout.
; cmp FIRST, then the counters.  A leg that is fast and wrong is the failure.

set speed 38400
set receive timeout 20
set parity none
set prefixing cautious
set block 3
set retry 30
log packets s16bdEF.pkt
send rcvef.dat
statistics
